  "content": "\n\n<div><div><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77a85ba0-86c0-41ee-b06d-4cc265a4a2a0\" width=\"2048\" height=\"918\" alt=\"GeckoLib\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pPEqBgJtZW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/730912704776110121?color=green&label=Discord&logo=Discord&logoColor=green&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"285\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgeckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/kofi-Buy_a_coffee-ff5f5f?logo=ko-fi&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=green&logoColor=green\" width=\"264\" height=\"39\"></a></strong><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>GeckoLib 是一款专为 Minecraft 模组设计的动画与渲染引擎，支持复杂的基于关键帧的 3D 动画、30 余种缓动函数、并发动画支持、声音与粒子关键帧、事件关键帧等功能。兼容 Forge、Fabric 和 NeoForge<br></strong></span></h3></div><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc9c7ee8-ddcc-4826-9836-801a8b69045b\" alt=\"安装指南\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">您可以在此处查看面向<strong>模组开发者</strong>的安装说明。</span><a href=\"https://github.com/bernie-g/geckolib/wiki/Installation-(Geckolib4)\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">点击这里</span></a>。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">对于<strong>普通玩家</strong>，只需下载该模组并按照常规方式放入您的 mods 文件夹即可。</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f43b07d1-c652-4371-9755-578ab04e1b39\" alt=\"文档\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">GeckoLib 提供了详尽的文档，形式为一份</span><a href=\"https://github.com/bernie-g/geckolib/wiki/Home\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">维基</span></a><span style=\"font-size:24px\">。我们花费了数小时编写这份维基，请务必阅读！</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f61e887e-12fb-4264-a120-e782b48f0508\" alt=\"技术支持\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">如果您有任何问题或需要上手帮助，欢迎加入我们的 Discord 服务器！</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bcf11ebf-c7d2-41f8-981a-8df6d7b9158e\" alt=\"参与贡献\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/bernie-g/geckolib/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull Request</a> 欢迎提交。对于重大更改，请先创建一个 Issue 讨论您想要修改的内容。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c01efae5-9cda-4f68-82f5-f0c99f3ff84a\" alt=\"许可证\" width=\"2048\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252flicense-MIT-green\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/bernie-g/geckolib?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"287\" height=\"125\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>由 BisectHosting 赞助</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">想和朋友一起开服游玩？不知道如何搭建？直接租用 BisectHosting 预配置好的服务器吧！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fgecko\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a97896c2-c19a-4143-acb2-e7de6e4a47c2\" alt=\"Bisect 托管\" width=\"512\" height=\"273\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;点击上方图片，选择套餐（至少 4GB），并使用我的优惠码 <strong>gecko </strong>享受首月 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，与好友尽情畅玩！</span></p></div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">标题图片由 JoLee 制作</span></p>",
